title: "Surrogate-based generative optimisation of diagrid tall buildings"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-03-11
license: MIT
abstract: "Software accompanying the manuscript 'Surrogate-based generative optimisation of diagrid tall buildings'. The repository contains a multi-input, multi-output feed-forward neural network surrogate and an NSGA-II based optimisation workflow for early-stage exploration of diagrid tall buildings under seismic loading."
